From c8734c08e2652b7e4945136b7983c9fed492cfdc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 03:32:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] Repertoire: mocap strike library, chain variants,
 learning moves from attackers

repertoire.rs segments the CMU takes into 297 forward strikes (276
punches, 21 kicks) by limb speed peaks with reach, posture, turn and
timing filters, each an unarmed Attack whose active window sits on the
measured contact. Every fighter starts with a few (seeded by entity) and
combat::start_swing swaps a chain attack for one of its extras 35 % of
the time. combat::resolve reports each melee blow that reaches a fighter
(Witnessed); after three of the same move the fighter learns a copy with
its own tempo for that moveset, and the player is told in the log.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017RTuqxaQfwuvFPEJrcXYEk
